-attack/articleshow/135019095.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135019095.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-something-you-cant-die-like-this-flydubai-pilot-capt-smit-machchar-recounts-cockpit-attack/articleshow/135019095.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/do-something-you-cant-die-like-this-flydubai-pilot-capt-smit-machchar-recounts-cockpit-attack/articleshow/135019095.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T23:55:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Manju V</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135019137,imgsize-224188.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['He kept on hitting': Indian flydubai pilot Smit Machchhar reveals what happened mid-flight as he was stabbed]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/he-kept-on-hitting-indian-flydubai-pilot-smit-machchhar-reveals-what-happened-mid-flight-as-he-was-stabbed/articleshow/135018356.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135018356.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Smit Machchhar was attacked by his co-pilot during a routine Flydubai flight, which he initially misinterpreted. As he attempted to defend himself, he lost consciousness amidst his desperate fight for survival. Other crew members intervened and helped regain control of the aircraft after he opened the cockpit door. The pilot expressed gratitude for the medical treatment he received after safely landing in Saudi Arabia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/he-kept-on-hitting-indian-flydubai-pilot-smit-machchhar-reveals-what-happened-mid-flight-as-he-was-stabbed/articleshow/135018356.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/he-kept-on-hitting-indian-flydubai-pilot-smit-machchhar-reveals-what-happened-mid-flight-as-he-was-stabbed/articleshow/135018356.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T23:20:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135018586,imgsize-94948.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['AIADMK would welcome Dhanush with both hands', says Rajendra Balaji]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiadmk-would-welcome-dhanush-with-both-hands-says-rajendra-balaji/articleshow/135018032.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135018032.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During a recent press conference, AIADMK leader K T Rajendra Balaji expressed enthusiasm about actor Dhanush possibly entering politics. He mentioned that the party would gladly accept Dhanush's involvement, highlighting the significant appeal actors like him have over the youth. Additionally, it was observed that Dhanush has rebranded his fan club to align with his evolving public persona, showcasing his readiness for greater engagement.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiadmk-would-welcome-dhanush-with-both-hands-says-rajendra-balaji/articleshow/135018032.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/aiadmk-would-welcome-dhanush-with-both-hands-says-rajendra-balaji/articleshow/135018032.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T23:00:23+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135018223,imgsize-57497.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Thoughts with those who have lost their loved ones': PM Modi on Kolkata stampede]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thoughts-with-those-who-have-lost-their-loved-ones-pm-modi-on-kolkata-stampede/articleshow/135017835.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135017835.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The incident occurred around 7.40 pm in the Girish Park police station area amid heavy crowds of pandal visitors and rainfall. As rain began, people waiting outside the pandal rushed forward, causing some to fall on the road and triggering a stampede, a senior police officer told PTI. All the injured were rescued and taken to Calcutta Medical College for treatment.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thoughts-with-those-who-have-lost-their-loved-ones-pm-modi-on-kolkata-stampede/articleshow/135017835.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thoughts-with-those-who-have-lost-their-loved-ones-pm-modi-on-kolkata-stampede/articleshow/135017835.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-17T22:57:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135018051,imgsize-911375.cms"/></item></channel></rss>